# Cursor local best practices

Before starting work that uses terminals/ports, when hitting `EADDRINUSE`, when starting/stopping a dev server, or before ending a local conversation:

1. Read and follow [`.agents/skills/cursor-local-best-practices/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/cursor-local-best-practices/SKILL.md).
2. Do not skip the wait/abort checks for other in-repo chats or the port cleanup steps.
